00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.410
Then just wait a little bit.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.360
I'll make dinner.

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:28.320
Huh, no way!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.500
It's okay, you don't have to do that!

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.470
Don't worry. You're hungry, right?

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.770
N-not really...

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:37.500
ah!

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.350
Just wait here. I'll make something quick.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:45.870
...Yuuto...

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.740
Here you go, Shiina!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.350
Wow. Looks good!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.730
Yuuto, you really made this!?

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:56.470
Yeah,

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.240
there was squid, so I made fried rice with it.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.570
Wow, wow!

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:03.010
I didn't know Yuuto was good at cooking.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:07.850
Well, this is also thanks to my sister and teacher's extreme education.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.350
Anyways, eat it while it's hot.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:11.320
Here.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:12.160
Huh...?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.390
What's wrong?

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:15.650
You're not gonna eat?

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.460
Y-yeah, I'll eat, but...

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:22.640
I think I can feed myself...

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:23.820
Oh!!

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:30.260
...do...it...

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:33.470
Huh...?

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.000
Uh, um...

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.460
Actually, can I ask you to do it...?

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:41.330
Um...can you feed me?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.750
Oh... of course.

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:54.820
Delicious!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.170
I see.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.990
Then don't hesitate to eat it up!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.120
Okay.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.530
Aw..mm...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.570
Thank you, Yuuto.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.420
It was delicious.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.680
I hope you get better soon.

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.380
Yeah...teeheehee.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.370
It's kinda nice, this kind of thing...

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.100
Hm?

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:22.360
Having someone here with you when you eat.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.630
I'm...always alone, so...

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:27.900
Really?

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.020
Yeah...

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.070
my dad's busy, so...

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.660
It's so much better than eating by yourself.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:37.940
teeheehee

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:41.440
Shiina...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.800
Is it this late already!?

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.060
I should go soon.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.140
Huh? R-really?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.400
I shouldn't stay so long and bother you either.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.400
Oh, don't worry about me!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.500
I'm not bothered at all!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:00.770
Rather, I actually want you to stay with me, and...ah!

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:01.550
Huh!?

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:04.590
Oh...wh-what am I saying...

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:05.790
I...I...

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.400
Sorry, forget what I just said.

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:11.500
Haha...ahahaha...oh man...

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.470
I'll stay a little longer.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.170
Huh!?

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:18.600
I feel like talking to Shiina for a little bit longer.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.570
Is that okay?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.540
Oh, y-yeah!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.170
...of course!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.450
I...I'm hungry...

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.050
Where is Yuuto!!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.400
Yuu-kun, come back~

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:14.320
Yuuto~

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:18.460
I made this squid rice, so if you want...

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.560
...Yuuto.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.800
Oh, oh yeah,

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:28.300
I forgot he said he hasn't slept since yesterday...

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:38.930
...Yuuto...

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:05.150
mm...

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.610
oh...I...

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:10.320
Was I sleeping?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.370
Good morning...

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:14.600
Oh, sorry.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.950
Even if I've been lacking sleep, can't believe I fell asleep at someone else's house...

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:18.880
Sorry.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.340
N-no, I'm sorry, too!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.070
Huh?

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.140
No, no, it's nothing.

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:38.030
Were you able to relax for New Year's?

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.000
No, not really.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.980
Turned out that until Ruko's New Year's break ended...

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:46.810
I was used and abused all the time.

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:53.170
Morning, Nogizaka-san!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:55.970
Oh!

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:59.490
Oh no~ s-sorry, Nogizaka-san!

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:01.370
No, don't worry about it.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:03.010
Really, I'm sorry.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:05.020
I was just a little surprised,

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:07.090
so don't be so sorry, please.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:10.110
No...let me apologize anyways.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:11.660
I said...

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:13.760
Really, I'm very sorry.

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:15.820
Good morning!

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:17.540
Good morning...

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:22.030
Haruka, did something happen between you and Shiina?

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:26.890
Um...I'm not really sure...

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:31.410
Hehe!

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:33.750
Hmm..

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:33.750
Hm?

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:18.020
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.080
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:29.280
(Mika)

00:24:18.070 --> 00:24:19.820
This week, it's Mika-sama!

00:24:19.820 --> 00:24:20.640
Wha...me!?

00:24:20.670 --> 00:24:22.650
Born April 20th, 14 years old!

00:24:22.650 --> 00:24:24.070
Blood type is O!

00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:25.330
Her three sizes are...

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:25.660
Wah!!

00:24:25.660 --> 00:24:26.880
That's a secret!!

00:24:26.820 --> 00:24:29.440
Next, Nogizaka Mika no Himitsu Purezza!

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:34.740
(Next: "I'll do you...")

00:24:29.510 --> 00:24:30.600
"I'll do you..."

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:33.760
I...actually have a thing for onii-san...

00:24:34.740 --> 00:24:39.900
See you next time!

00:24:34.740 --> 00:24:39.900
Nogizaka no Himitsu Purezza!
